    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tale of hubris in the far-flung future,\u00a0 inspired by that one Sci-Fi novel.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NSY 10,006, It is the waning days of the emperor\u00a0Neath Ithicia\u2019m the second. No clear heir to the throne of the Galactic Ithicia\u2019m Empire exists. Follow the secretive Black Matter Adventists as they hatch a plot to take power over the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OMNN is a grand space opera inspired by various Sci-Fi media and vintage 3D games. Experience a grand plot to undermine universal power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mele combat: Learn to dash, block and crit your opponents.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585620/extras/0d5e0ca83cd56b58fbca92c0840655c6.poster.avif?t=1743783787\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585620/extras/0d5e0ca83cd56b58fbca92c0840655c6.webm?t=1743783787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585620/extras/0d5e0ca83cd56b58fbca92c0840655c6.mp4?t=1743783787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep story:\u00a0 Talk to NPCs and read logs scattered throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse locations: Explore multiple parts of the galactic\u00a0Ithicia\u2019m Empire. Experience barren wastes and opulent keeps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tale of hubris in the far-flung future,\u00a0 inspired by that one Sci-Fi novel.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NSY 10,006, It is the waning days of the emperor\u00a0Neath Ithicia\u2019m the second. No clear heir to the throne of the Galactic Ithicia\u2019m Empire exists. Follow the secretive Black Matter Adventists as they hatch a plot to take power over the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OMNN is a grand space opera inspired by various Sci-Fi media and vintage 3D games. Experience a grand plot to undermine universal power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mele combat: Learn to dash, block and crit your opponents.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585620/extras/0d5e0ca83cd56b58fbca92c0840655c6.poster.avif?t=1743783787\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585620/extras/0d5e0ca83cd56b58fbca92c0840655c6.webm?t=1743783787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585620/extras/0d5e0ca83cd56b58fbca92c0840655c6.mp4?t=1743783787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep story:\u00a0 Talk to NPCs and read logs scattered throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse locations: Explore multiple parts of the galactic\u00a0Ithicia\u2019m Empire. Experience barren wastes and opulent keeps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
